<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day bills worth 600 million pound.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day bills worth 600 million pound.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 600 million pounds for auction on October 21 and issue on October 22, when 182-day bills worth 820.245 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 10.257 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
